{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "SAS Viya CAS Table Management API",
    "description": "SAS Viya CAS 資料表管理端點文檔。\n\n覆蓋 `casManagement/dataSources` 及 `casManagement/servers` 相關操作：\n- 取得 Caslib 下的資料表清單\n- 取得單一資料表詳細資訊\n- 切換資料表的載入/卸載狀態（loaded / unloaded）\n\n**所有請求均需攜帶 Bearer Token**。\n\n⚠️ **程式碼已知問題**（`table.py` 中的 Bug）：\n`utils/_api/table.py` 引用了以下三個 header 函式，但這些函式在\n`config/headers_variable.py` 中**並不存在**：\n- `sas_viya_item_get_headers`\n- `sas_viya_table_get_headers`\n- `sas_viya_table_put_headers`\n\n`headers_variable.py` 實際上只定義以下 4 個 header 函式：\n1. `access_token_headers()`\n2. `sas_viya_get_headers(access_token)`\n3. `sas_viya_get_content_headers(access_token)`\n4. `sas_viya_post_job_execution_headers(access_token)`\n\n此文檔以**實際 HTTP 請求所需的推斷 Headers** 為準。\n\n**來源程式碼**：`utils/_api/table.py`\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{sas_viya_host}",
      "description": "SAS Viya 伺服器",
      "variables": {
        "sas_viya_host": {
          "default": "your-sas-viya-instance",
          "description": "由環境變數 `base_url` 設定"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "SAS Viya OAuth 2.0 Bearer Token。\nHeader 格式：`Authorization: Bearer {access_token}`\n"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "TableLink": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "HATEOAS 連結物件",
        "properties": {
          "method": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "rel": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "href": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "uri": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          }
        }
      },
      "TableItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "CAS 資料表摘要。\n來源：`schema/sas_viya/table/response.py` (推斷，因 table.py 有 import bug)\n",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "name"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "version": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "資料表唯一識別碼",
            "example": "table-id-001"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "資料表名稱",
            "example": "SCORING_INPUT"
          },
          "caslib": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "所屬 Caslib 名稱",
            "example": "CASUSER"
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "loaded",
              "unloaded"
            ],
            "description": "資料表載入狀態"
          },
          "rowCount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "資料表行數",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "columnCount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "資料表欄位數",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "links": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableLink"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TablesListResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "CAS 資料表清單回應",
        "required": [
          "count",
          "items"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "version": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "count": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "符合條件的資料表總數"
          },
          "start": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "items": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableItem"
            }
          },
          "links": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableLink"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TableStateBody": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "切換資料表狀態的請求 Body。\n來源：`utils/_api/table.py::change_castable_state`\n\n**注意**：`outputCaslibName` 和 `outputTableName` 為必填欄位，\n內容與目前的 Caslib 和 Table 名稱相同（即原地 load/unload）。\n",
        "required": [
          "outputCaslibName",
          "outputTableName"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "outputCaslibName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "輸出 Caslib 名稱（通常與操作目標相同）",
            "example": "CASUSER"
          },
          "outputTableName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "輸出資料表名稱（通常與操作目標相同）",
            "example": "SCORING_INPUT"
          }
        }
      },
      "TableStateResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "資料表狀態更新回應",
        "properties": {
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "loaded",
              "unloaded"
            ],
            "description": "更新後的資料表狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/casManagement/dataSources/cas~fs~cas-shared-default~fs~{caslib}/tables": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "取得 Caslib 下的所有資料表",
        "operationId": "getTableInfos",
        "tags": [
          "Tables"
        ],
        "description": "取得指定 Caslib 下的所有 CAS 資料表清單，含各表的載入狀態。\n\n**HTTP Method**：GET\n\n**URL 格式**（來源 `table.py` 常數）：\n```\n{base_url}casManagement/dataSources/cas~fs~cas-shared-default~fs~{caslib}/tables?limit={limit}&start=0\n```\n\n**路徑中的編碼說明**：\n- `cas~fs~cas-shared-default~fs~{caslib}` 是路徑式的 dataSource 識別碼\n- `cas` → CAS 伺服器\n- `cas-shared-default` → CAS Server 名稱\n- `{caslib}` → 目標 Caslib 名稱（如 `CASUSER`, `Public` 等）\n\n**使用場景**：\n- 列出 Caslib 下所有可用的 CAS 資料表\n- 確認特定資料表是否已載入（state = `loaded`）\n\n⚠️ **已知 Bug**：此端點對應的 `get_table_infos` 函式引用了不存在的\n`sas_viya_table_get_headers`，實際執行時會拋出 `ImportError`。\n\n**來源程式碼**：`utils/_api/table.py::get_table_infos`\n",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "caslib",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "CAS Library 名稱（大小寫敏感）",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "CASUSER"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "最大回傳筆數",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 1000
            },
            "example": 1000
          },
          {
            "name": "start",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "分頁起始位置（固定為 0）",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 0
            },
            "example": 0
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功取得資料表清單",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TablesListResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "success": {
                    "summary": "成功回應範例",
                    "value": {
                      "version": 1.0,
                      "count": 3,
                      "start": 0,
                      "limit": 1000,
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "id": "table-id-001",
                          "name": "SCORING_INPUT",
                          "caslib": "CASUSER",
                          "state": "loaded",
                          "rowCount": 5000,
                          "columnCount": 25
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "table-id-002",
                          "name": "PATIENT_HISTORY",
                          "caslib": "CASUSER",
                          "state": "unloaded",
                          "rowCount": null,
                          "columnCount": null
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "table-id-003",
                          "name": "MODEL_OUTPUT",
                          "caslib": "CASUSER",
                          "state": "loaded",
                          "rowCount": 200,
                          "columnCount": 5
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "請求無效（Caslib 不存在）"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Bearer Token 無效或過期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/casManagement/dataSources/cas~fs~cas-shared-default~fs~{caslib}/tables/{tableName}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "取得特定資料表詳細資訊",
        "operationId": "getTable",
        "tags": [
          "Tables"
        ],
        "description": "根據 Caslib 和資料表名稱，取得單一 CAS 資料表的詳細資訊。\n\n**HTTP Method**：GET\n\n**URL 格式**：\n```\n{base_url}casManagement/dataSources/cas~fs~cas-shared-default~fs~{caslib}/tables/{tableName}\n```\n\n**使用場景**：\n- 確認特定資料表的載入狀態\n- 取得資料表的 Row Count 和 Column Count\n- 在執行 scoring job 前確認 input table 已 loaded\n\n⚠️ **已知 Bug**：此端點對應的 `get_table` 函式引用了不存在的\n`sas_viya_item_get_headers`，實際執行時會拋出 `ImportError`。\n\n**來源程式碼**：`utils/_api/table.py::get_table`\n",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "caslib",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "CAS Library 名稱",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "CASUSER"
          },
          {
            "name": "tableName",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "資料表名稱（大小寫敏感）",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "SCORING_INPUT"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功取得資料表詳細資訊",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableItem"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "loaded": {
                    "summary": "已載入的資料表",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "table-id-001",
                      "name": "SCORING_INPUT",
                      "caslib": "CASUSER",
                      "state": "loaded",
                      "rowCount": 5000,
                      "columnCount": 25,
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  },
                  "unloaded": {
                    "summary": "未載入的資料表",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "table-id-002",
                      "name": "PATIENT_HISTORY",
                      "caslib": "CASUSER",
                      "state": "unloaded",
                      "rowCount": null,
                      "columnCount": null,
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "資料表不存在"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Bearer Token 無效或過期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/casManagement/servers/cas-shared-default/caslibs/{caslib}/tables/{tableName}/state": {
      "put": {
        "summary": "切換 CAS 資料表載入狀態",
        "operationId": "changeCasTableState",
        "tags": [
          "Tables"
        ],
        "description": "切換指定 CAS 資料表的載入狀態（`loaded` 或 `unloaded`）。\n\n**HTTP Method**：PUT\n\n**URL 格式**（來源 `table.py::change_castable_state`）：\n```\n{base_url}casManagement/servers/cas-shared-default/caslibs/{caslib}/tables/{tableName}/state?value={state}\n```\n\n**使用場景**：\n- `value=loaded`：將資料表載入 CAS in-memory（在 Scoring Job 前需確保 input table 已 loaded）\n- `value=unloaded`：將資料表從 CAS 記憶體卸載（釋放記憶體）\n\n**注意事項**：\n- Query parameter `value` 指定目標狀態\n- Request body 中的 `outputCaslibName` 和 `outputTableName` 需提供，\n  通常與 path 參數相同\n- `TABLE_STATE` 型別：`Literal[\"loaded\", \"unloaded\"]`（來源 `project_typing/_typing.py`）\n\n⚠️ **已知 Bug**：此端點對應的 `change_castable_state` 函式引用了不存在的\n`sas_viya_table_put_headers`，實際執行時會拋出 `ImportError`。\n\n**來源程式碼**：`utils/_api/table.py::change_castable_state`\n",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "caslib",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "CAS Library 名稱",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "CASUSER"
          },
          {
            "name": "tableName",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "資料表名稱",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "SCORING_INPUT"
          },
          {
            "name": "value",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "目標狀態",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "loaded",
                "unloaded"
              ]
            },
            "example": "loaded"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableStateBody"
              },
              "examples": {
                "load_table": {
                  "summary": "載入資料表（loaded）",
                  "value": {
                    "outputCaslibName": "CASUSER",
                    "outputTableName": "SCORING_INPUT"
                  }
                },
                "unload_table": {
                  "summary": "卸載資料表（unloaded）",
                  "value": {
                    "outputCaslibName": "CASUSER",
                    "outputTableName": "SCORING_INPUT"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "資料表狀態切換成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableStateResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "loaded": {
                    "summary": "已成功載入",
                    "value": {
                      "state": "loaded"
                    }
                  },
                  "unloaded": {
                    "summary": "已成功卸載",
                    "value": {
                      "state": "unloaded"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "請求無效（如狀態值不在 loaded/unloaded 範圍內）"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "資料表或 Caslib 不存在"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Bearer Token 無效或過期"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
